{"articleNo":"461563","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=461563&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 대학교재 불법복제 근절 관련 협조 요청","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.09.04","hit":"5088","attachments":[{"name":"[문화체육관광부] 대학가 신학기 출판물 불법복제 예방 협조 요청.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=461563&attachNo=127024"},{"name":"저작권보호 안내 및 불법스캔 방지 포스터.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=461563&attachNo=127025"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0pt 5pt 0pt 49.4pt; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -49.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">관련&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">문화체육관광부 저작권보호과</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">-3192(2023.8.16.)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">대학가 신학기 출판물 불법복제 예방 협조 요청</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 10pt 5pt 0pt 16pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">위 호와 관련하여 대학 내에서 불법복제물 제작 및 유통과 같은 저작권 침해 행위가 발생하지 않도록&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 11pt;\">아래와 같이 협조를 요청해 온 바</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">교내</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">외 복사업체 및 셀프 스캔업체 등을 통한 대학교재 등 출판물의</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">불법복제 등 저작권법 위반사례가 발생하지 않도록 적극 협조</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 10pt 5pt 0pt 16pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">아울러</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">전 단과대학 및 학과에서는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">학내 불법복제물 제작 및 유통 예방을 위해 학생에&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">대한 저작권&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">보호 인식개선</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">및&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">교재 불법복사와 불법복제&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">PDF</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">파일 공유 등 저작권 침해 행위가 발생되지 않도록</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">아래 협조사항을 적극적으로 홍보하고</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">, [</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">붙임</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">2]&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">저작권보호 안내 및 불법스캔 방지 포스터를 게시</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 10pt 5pt 0pt 16pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -16pt; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&lt;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">협 조 사 항&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&gt;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 5pt 5pt 0pt 31pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -31pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">가</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">교직원 및 학생 대상 출판물 저작권 안내</span></p><p style=\"margin: 5pt 5pt 0pt 25.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -25.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">ㅇ&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">저작권자의 허락 없이 도서를 복제</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">복사</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">스캔</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, PDF</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">파일 공유 등</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">하는 행위는 저작권법 위반이며</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">저작권법 제</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">136</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">조</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">벌칙</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">제</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">항제</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">호에 의거&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">년 이하의 징역 또는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">천만원 이하의 벌금에 처하거나</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">병과할 수 있음을 안내</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 52pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -26pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">ㅇ&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">학과 내에서 불법복제물</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">스캔본</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, PDF</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">파일</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">공유 금지 및 교재 등 출판물을 복사하여 학생들에게 일괄 배부하지 않도록 지도 요망</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 48.1pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -24.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">ㅇ&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">강의 시간에 학생들에게 저작권 보호 및 침해 행위 근절을 위한 지도를 할 수 있도록 안내 요망</span></p><p style=\"margin: 5pt 5pt 0pt 25.7pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -25.7pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">나</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">출판물 불법복제 예방 안내</span></p><p style=\"margin: 5pt 5pt 0pt 25.7pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -25.7pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 11pt;\">ㅇ&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">출판물 불법복제 근절 포스터를 단과대학</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">학과</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">홈페이지 및 게시판 게시</span></p><p style=\"margin: 15pt 5pt 0pt 0pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">붙임&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1. [</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">문화체육관광부</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">]</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">대학가 신학기 출판물 불법복제 예방 협조 요청&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">부</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 5pt 0pt 0pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: 한양신명조; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 2.5; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">저작권보호 안내 및 불법스캔 방지 포스터 각&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">부</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">끝</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
